not read anymore, because the swap rates file covers the same dates. To rebuild the data, delete
\verb{<cachedir>/db/input/b3-reference-rates} and \verb{<cachedir>/db/staging/b3-reference-rates} and run
\code{fetch_marketdata("b3-reference-rates", refdate = ...)} again for the dates you need.
